# ../ace-m1/src/T05.at, sha256 84541676…): borrowed `str` literals with an
# embedded NUL; `==`/`!=` compare the FULL bytes with no normalization
# ("A\0B" != "A", "A\0B" == "A\0B"). Pure views — no allocation, empty
# resource plan. Oracle 42.

```test-case
case {
  schema: "autolang.case/2"
  id: "a2r-hir-record-text-902.t05"
  tags: ["a2r-hir", "record-text", "borrowed-text", "nul"]
